Input: {"correlation_id": "ETH-USDT-1h-1789876799999", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1789913700000, "account": {"equity": "10001.652944728374", "available_margin": "9755.0651727283744", "currency": "USDT", "position_mode": "HEDGE", "as_of_ms": 1789913700000}, "position": {"position_id": "wf-main-1", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "side": "SHORT", "quantity": "0.478", "mark_price": "2579.37", "ownership_role": "MAIN", "as_of_ms": 1789913700000}, "positions": [{"position_id": "wf-main-1", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "side": "SHORT", "quantity": "0.478", "mark_price": "2579.37", "ownership_role": "MAIN", "as_of_ms": 1789913700000}], "executor_state": {"as_of_ms": 1789913700000, "controller_id": "brooks-walkforward-10d", "executors": [{"executor_id": "wf-exec-1", "status": "RUNNING", "trading_pair": "ETH-USDT", "controller_id": "brooks-walkforward-10d"}]}, "open_orders": [], "recent_fills": [], "fills_since_last_event": [], "original_trade_intent": {"schema": "brooks.trade-intent.v2", "role": "TRADER", "decision": "ENTER_SHORT", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1789876799999, "market_context": {"location": "2586.68 sits just below the broken 2604.75 tight-range low and ~113 points off the 2700.00 high; next larger references below are the H4 2528.8/2537.57 range top and the H4 higher low 2486.12 (bar 1789718400000).", "primary_regime_and_phase": {"D1_context_current": "bull-trend / breakout-spike; 29-bar range 2357.18-2700.00; second rejected push at 2700.00 (bar 1789776000000, upper tail ~67) after 2680.00 (bar 1789084800000, upper tail ~165)", "H1": "rollover after the failed 2658.79-2700.00 push; H1 bar open_time_ms 1789869600000 (open 2617.83, high 2622.64, low 2571, close 2573.13), then H1 bar open_time_ms 1789873200000 (open 2572.94, high 2594.57, low 2569.8, close 2586.68)", "H4_context_stale_replaced_by_raw_read": "raw H4 bar 1789862400000-1789876799999 is a bear bar (open 2632.98, high 2633.05, low 2569.8, close 2586.68) that closes below the seven-bar H4 tight-range low 2604.75 (H4 bar open 1789776000000, low 2604.75)", "M15": "bear breakout bar index 115 (open 2603.75, high 2606.04, low 2571, close 2573.13) below 2604.75, then a four-bar overlap 2569.8-2594.57 (bars 116-119) with declining highs"}}, "setup": {"type": "bear breakout pullback: short stop below the M15 bear flag 2569.8-2594.57 after the 2604.75 breakdown", "trigger_status": "pending", "signal_quality": "clear", "location_assessment": "favorable", "no_trade_reason": null}, "decision_timeframe": "M15", "context_timeframes_used": ["H1", "M15", "H4", "D1"], "entry_mechanism": "breakout_pullback", "trigger": {"reference": "M15 bar 117 low - bear-flag low, also below M15 bar 115 low 2571", "price_field": "low", "price": "2569.8", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 117, "open_time_ms": 1789874100000, "close_time_ms": 1789874999999}, "kind": "stop", "direction": "below"}, "invalidation": {"reference": "M15 bar 117 high - bear-flag pullback high (equal to M15 bar 116 high 2594.57)", "price_field": "high", "price": "2594.57", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 117, "open_time_ms": 1789874100000, "close_time_ms": 1789874999999}}, "evidence_for": ["M15 bar 115 (open_time_ms 1789872300000, close_time_ms 1789873199999) is a 35.04-point bear bar: open 2603.75, high 2606.04, low 2571, close 2573.13, closing 2.13 above its low and breaking the 2604.75 low of the prior tight range; its M15 volume 917804.613 is the largest of the last 30 M15 bars.", "Raw H4 bar 1789862400000-1789876799999 (open 2632.98, high 2633.05, low 2569.8, close 2586.68) closes below the H4 seven-bar range low 2604.75, ending the H4 higher-low chain 2370.54 -> 2435.71 -> 2486.12 -> 2604.75; the stale H4 analyst context was replaced with this successful raw 120-bar read.", "M15 bars 116-119 overlap only 2569.8-2594.57 with declining highs 2594.57 (bar 116), 2594.57 (bar 117), 2587.03 (bar 118), 2586.69 (bar 119) - a bear flag holding below the broken 2604.75 rather than reclaiming it.", "H1 bar open_time_ms 1789869600000 (open 2617.83, high 2622.64, low 2571, close 2573.13, volume 2568125.853) is the widest H1 range of the drop and closes near its low, and the current D1 context shows the 2700.00 high (bar 1789776000000) rejected with a ~67-point upper tail after the earlier 2680.00 rejection (bar 1789084800000)."], "evidence_against": ["D1 context (current) is bull-trend/breakout-spike with Always-In long and the window's highest close 2632.98 (bar 1789776000000); the short is counter to that, and 2586.68 is only ~59 points below the middle of the large D1 2357.18-2700.00 range, where Brooks expects two-sided trade and weaker follow-through.", "Follow-through on the breakdown was weak: the bar immediately after the breakout bar (M15 bar 116, open 2572.94, high 2594.57, low 2570.27, close 2579.45) closed back up inside the broken range, and the last bar (M15 bar 119, open 2580.72, high 2586.69, low 2579.19, close 2586.68) closed at its high, showing buyers at the breakdown level.", "Failed strong bars are a feature of this window: H4 bar 1789128000000 (open 2457.12, high 2680.00, close 2555.52) gave its entire 235.81-point range back, so the current H4 bear bar may be an overreaction inside a bull leg with the 2486.12/2537.57 zone likely to attract buyers."], "qualitative_confidence": "medium", "uncertainty": ["The trigger is a pending stop at 2569.8; the four-bar flag may extend toward 2594.57 or 2606.04 first, so the order may stay unfilled or be invalidated before a second leg develops.", "The H4 analyst context is stale, so the larger bull-channel versus range-top read rests on raw H4 bars only; whether 2586.68 is a completed higher-timeframe bear bar or a mid-pullback value cannot be settled from closed bars.", "M15 ranges near the flag are tight (about 5-12 points), so the 2569.8 stop sits within normal noise distance of the 2569.8-2594.57 flag and could be probed rather than run by a genuine second leg."], "conditions_that_change_market_read": ["An M15 close back above 2594.57 (bar 117 high), and especially acceptance above 2606.04 (M15 bar 115 high), negates the bear breakout and restores the D1/H4 bull-flag read.", "A bear M15 bar closing below 2569.8 with a range wider than ~25 points confirms the second leg and shifts focus to the H4 2528.8/2537.57 and 2486.12 references.", "An H4/D1 close above 2700.00 reopens the D1 breakout read, while a close below 2486.12 (H4 bar 1789718400000 low) would confirm a larger reversal rather than a pullback."]}, "latest_trader_intent": null, "latest_market_context": null, "management_history": [{"schema": "brooks.management-decision.v2", "role": "POSITION_MANAGER", "decision_time_ms": 1789903800000, "action": "HOLD", "position_ids": ["wf-main-1"], "reason": "The single MAIN short (wf-main-1, ETH-USDT SHORT 0.478, mark 2571.7) is coherent: authoritative ownership_role MAIN matches hedge_state structure_status single_main with main_position_id wf-main-1, main_side SHORT, main_size 0.478, hedge_side null, hedge_size 0, hedge_ratio 0, unresolved false, margin_health SAFE, executor wf-exec-1 RUNNING on ETH-USDT, and empty open_orders/recent_fills/fills_since_last_event. The governing policy brooks-pm-v1:brooks-walkforward-10d has strategy_stop_required false, so an empty protective-order set is policy-compliant and the PM cannot place or move a stop. The recorded premise (bear breakout below the 2604.75 H4/M15 range low, short under the 2569.8 bear-flag low) remains challenged but not contradicted: the two newest closed M15 bars took the flag low marginally under the 2569.8 trigger (1789902000000 low 2568.78, close 2570.41; 1789902900000 low 2568.16, close 2571.7) yet both closed back above the trigger and 24+ points below the 2594.57 invalidation, with no wide-range follow-through bar and no close over 2594.57. A shallow probe that resolves neither the trigger decisively nor the invalidation is not thesis failure and does not mandate reduce, close, or hedge.", 