ded trade and weaker follow-through; prior strong bars in this window gave back their whole range.", "The snapshot supplies no entry price/cost basis for wf-main-1 and no fills_since_last_event while the intent carried a pending trigger, so the exact fill and current PnL of this exposure cannot be verified, capping confidence below 'low' uncertainty."]}, "risk": {"exposure_before": ["ETH-USDT SHORT 0.478 (wf-main-1), mark 2571.7, gross notional ~1229.27 USD, hedge_ratio 0"], "exposure_after": ["ETH-USDT SHORT 0.478 (wf-main-1) unchanged, mark 2571.7, gross notional ~1229.27 USD, hedge_ratio 0"], "protection_status": "not_applicable", "costs_considered": ["Trading fees apply to any eventual reduce/close of the short; none are incurred by holding.", "Funding on the 0.478 ETH-USDT short accrues while the position remains open.", "No hedge-related cost is considered because hedge_size is 0 and hedge_ratio 0."], "uncertainty": "medium"}, "execution": {"orders": [], "cancel_order_ids": [], "replace_orders": []}, "hedge_plan": null, "market_analysis_request": null, "conditions_that_change_action": ["An M15 close above 2594.57, and especially acceptance above 2606.04, hits the recorded invalidation and would move the decision toward CLOSE or REDUCE under the allowed actions.", "A decisive M15 close below 2569.8 that holds, with a range wider than ~25 points and follow-through, confirms the second leg and supports continued HOLD with attention to the H4 2528.8/2537.57 and 2486.12 references.", "Any new fill, open order, quantity change, or partial fill requires RECONCILE_STATE before another action.", "Any change in hedge_state (unresolved true, orphan/duplicate leg, non-zero hedge_size) or a downgrade of margin_health to WARNING/CRITICAL would force re-evaluation toward REDUCE, CLOSE, or RECONCILE_STATE."], "reduce_fraction": null, "shadow_mode": false}, {"schema": "brooks.management-decision.v2", "role": "POSITION_MANAGER", "decision_time_ms": 1789904700000, "action": "HOL